{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"08ab PS3 pushed to Gerrit change 2603 (https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/2603), commit 98ce6a63, Change-Id Ic51693e5 (preserved via amend). Root-caused the PS2 full-suite ripple: after fixing the 17 earlier failures, a CI-equivalent full unit run (REBAR_REQUIRE_EXTRAS=1, all extras, 15442 passed) surfaced 2 remaining failures in test_mechanism_delta.py — the mechanism-delta ratchet flagged a NEW ci_gate because I had RENAMED the _build-and-test.yml install step ('...ui extras' -> '...ui + grounding-terraform extras'). --update-stale refuses to sync the baseline while new>0 even when marker-admitted, and hand-editing the baseline / --lock are discouraged escape hatches. Disposition: a CI step RENAME is not a legitimate new mechanism (it's exactly the churn the ratchet discourages), so I reverted the step NAME to the committed baseline name and kept only the functional run-command change (added --extra grounding-terraform). Result: mechanism-delta new=0 increased=0 stale=0, both mechanism tests green. Also fixed 2 E501 line-length regressions in the wrapped run_pass1 test-doubles (test_model_class_ladder.py, test_pass1_finder_model.py). Full preflight re-run GREEN: make lint exit 0 (incl. ratchet), make typecheck 758 files clean, CI-parity 30 passed, ladder tests 27 passed, held-out oracle + optionality 8 passed. Amended the 5 CI-ripple fix files into the commit (workflow + parity + 3 ladder test-doubles). Updated file_impact 31->36 paths (added the 5 CI-plumbing files with reasons). PS3 CI now running; prior LLM-Review-1 and Verified-1 auto-removed on new patchset. Next: watch Verified/LLM-Review on 2603; close 08ab only after Verified +1."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788496990928704761,"uuid":"d5e84ec5-8199-4470-9c7c-c1095066c7a7"}